{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19102210","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19102210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910221001:1":{"text":"这就是传说中的外部海域啊……","source_cn":"这就是传说中的外部海域啊……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x06E0040D864C02A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910221002:0":{"text":"因为有海裔在附近失踪过，阿嬷、妈妈、沫霖姐姐都说这里危...","source_cn":"因为有海裔在附近失踪过，阿嬷、妈妈、沫霖姐姐都说这里危...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910221003:0":{"text":"听了那么多有关它的事情，终于能来这里了。我一定要把之前...","source_cn":"听了那么多有关它的事情，终于能来这里了。我一定要把之前...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910221004:1":{"text":"刚一进入外海，艾菲拉便如同归海的游鱼般，钻钻这个洞窟、...","source_cn":"刚一进入外海，艾菲拉便如同归海的游鱼般，钻钻这个洞窟、...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910221005:1":{"text":"随着她的身影，你谨慎地打量着四周。但与你想象的不同，令...","source_cn":"随着她的身影，你谨慎地打量着四周。但与你想象的不同，令...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910221006:0":{"text":"哪值得好奇了？这和其他海不是没两样吗。","source_cn":"哪值得好奇了？这和其他海不是没两样吗。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x587CC12E5471CE98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910221007:0":{"text":"也没啥能用来修理水行器的特别材料。这就是外海？","source_cn":"也没啥能用来修理水行器的特别材料。这就是外海？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x263169D979A2837A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1910221007":{"text":"也没啥特别的材料。这就是外海？","source_cn":"也没啥特别的材料。这就是外海？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5A4CFBADA6B8FE1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910221008:1":{"text":"阿嬷是这么说的。因为，独自外出的海裔，偶尔会在外部海域失踪。","source_cn":"阿嬷是这么说的。因为，独自外出的海裔，偶尔会在外部海域失踪。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x3E7FEB08B9F1349D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910221010:1":{"text":"阿嬷说，在二十年前，我们这辈最年长的哥哥，就是在这里失踪的。","source_cn":"阿嬷说，在二十年前，我们这辈最年长的哥哥，就是在这里失踪的。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xCD27DB277017AF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910221011:1":{"text":"失踪？难道撞上解决不了的大鱼怪了？","source_cn":"失踪？难道撞上解决不了的大鱼怪了？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B4F3A50630D57A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910221012:1":{"text":"一开始大家也是这么猜的，但阿嬷她们出来找了好几次，都没...","source_cn":"一开始大家也是这么猜的，但阿嬷她们出来找了好几次，都没...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910221013:1":{"text":"而且，就算我们海裔真的遇到大鱼怪，在被抓走前也一定会反击的。","source_cn":"而且，就算我们海裔真的遇到大鱼怪，在被抓走前也一定会反击的。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x76DB9249686780A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910221014:1":{"text":"但阿嬷他们找了又找，这里却连一点搏斗的痕迹也没有……哥...","source_cn":"但阿嬷他们找了又找，这里却连一点搏斗的痕迹也没有……哥...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1910221014":{"text":"但阿嬷他们找了又找，这里却连一点搏斗的痕迹也没有……哥哥就像凭空消失了一样。","source_cn":"但阿嬷他们找了又找，这里却连一点搏斗的痕迹也没有……哥哥就像凭空消失了一样。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x0614835EFE0DA5C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910221015:1":{"text":"我也这么猜过……但谁也不知道事实到底是怎样的。","source_cn":"我也这么猜过……但谁也不知道事实到底是怎样的。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x0EA4D08A3A92C220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910221016:1":{"text":"这也不对，那也说不通，真够玄乎的。","source_cn":"这也不对，那也说不通，真够玄乎的。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x9AB4E0B2CC8581C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910221017:1":{"text":"是呀……之后，大家就不再来这里围猎，也不再调查藏在外海...","source_cn":"是呀……之后，大家就不再来这里围猎，也不再调查藏在外海...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910221018:1":{"text":"可我认为，不应该就这样放弃！","source_cn":"可我认为，不应该就这样放弃！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7DB4531FF2DEC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910221019:1":{"text":"我一直想来这里看看，我想知道那些失踪的家人到底为什么会...","source_cn":"我一直想来这里看看，我想知道那些失踪的家人到底为什么会...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910221020:1":{"text":"——我很好奇！","source_cn":"——我很好奇！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x419BCF8C9A46C8DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fema